# NOTE: profiles.yml is deliberately NOT ignored. It is environment config as
# code - the reference workflows have no other way to learn what `dev` and
# `prod` mean, and a gitignored profiles.yml made every scaffolded project's
# first CI run die at `mbt compile` with "no profiles.yml found". Secrets never
# belong in it: env_var('NAME') keeps them out of the file AND redacts them
# everywhere they could be printed (see SECURITY.md).

